## Case: nested-finally
id: "av.parity.1087.nested-finally"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1087"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn leaf() int { fail("leaf") }
fn middle() int {
    try { return leaf() } finally { print("middle") }
}
fn main() int {
    try { return middle() } catch e { print(e); return 42 } finally { print("outer") }
}
```

