## Case: local-borrow-unwind
id: "av.parity.1087.local-borrow-unwind"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1087"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn leaf() int { fail("leaf") }
fn main() int {
    var text = "before".clone()
    try {
        let held = text.view
        let n = leaf()
        return n + held.len()
    } catch e { text = "after".clone() }
    return 37 + text.len()
}
```

