## Case: loop-exits
id: "av.parity.1087.loop-exits"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1087"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn main() int {
    var n = 0
    var events = 0
    loop {
        n = n + 1
        try {
            if n == 1 { continue }
            if n == 2 { break }
            return 0
        } finally { events = events * 10 + n }
    }
    return 30 + events
}
```

