## Case: lazy-defaults
id: "av.parity.1087.lazy-defaults"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1087"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn never() int { fail("an unused default was evaluated") }
fn main() int {
    let left = Some(40)
    let right = Some(2)
    let absent ?int = None
    let n = left.?(never())
    let m = right ?? never()
    return n + m + absent.?(0)
}
```

