## Case: conditional-list-effects
id: "av.parity.1087.conditional-list-effects"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1087"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn letter(label str, number int) int {
    print(label)
    return number
}
fn never() int { fail("skipped element was evaluated") }
fn main() int {
    let xs = [
        letter("first", 40),
        if false {never()},
        if true {letter("second", 2)}
    ]
    let no_items = [if false {never()}]
    return xs[0] + xs[1] + no_items.len()
}
```

